# Eureka puts the first player's permanent onto the battlefield before the next player chooses (CR 608.2c).
[Bot1 Deck]
Eureka
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Eureka.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Forest)
[Handover Bot2.Choose]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Pearl; Forest
